@NODE iNTRODUCTiON "iNTRODUCTiON OF FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0"

FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD iS A TOOL WHiCH iS ABLE TO STRiP TAG-LiNES WiTH
BBS-ADVERTS OUT OF THE FiLE_iD.DiZ AND ADD AN OWN TAG-LiNE.

iT HAS @{"FEATURES" LiNK FEATURES} THAT OTHER STRiPPER DOESN'T HAVE.

@ENDNODE

@NODE FEATURES "FEATURES OF FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0"

WiTH FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD YOU ARE ALSO ABLE TO STRiP WiLD-CARDS OUT
OF THE FiLE_iD.DiZ. THAT MEANS YOU ARE ALSO ABLE TO STRiP TAG-LiNE WiTH
A DATE OR UPLOAD TiME. JUST iNSERT THE CHARACTERS THAT NEVER CHANGE iNTO
THE STRiP-CONFiG AND YOU'LL NEVER SEE THiS LiNE AGAiN iN THE FiLE_iD.DiZ'S
UPLOADED TO YOUR BBS. FiLE_iD.DiZ WiLL BE STARTED AS THE FiLECHECK.iNFO,
BUT WHEN iT FOUND ANY STRiPABLE LiNE YOU'LL NEVER FiND iT iN YOUR DiR-FiLE
AGAiN, EVEN WHEN iT iS SHOWN BY YOUR FiLE_iD.DiZ-DOOR (E.G. THE ONE FROM
BYTEANDi). YOU CAN ALSO ADD LiNES TO WHiCH THE UPLOAD-DATE AND TiME WiLL
BE ADDED (6 DiFFERENT STYLES ARE AVAiLABLE AND BE CHOSEN RANDOMLY).

YOU CAN ADD AS MANY NORMAL TAG-LiNES AS YOU WANT TO THE FiLE_iD.DiZ.
THE LiNES WiLL BE CHOSEN RANDOMLY.

FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0 SUPPORTS THE FOLLOWiNG FORMATS:

  1st 'TXT' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.
  2nd 'ANS' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.
  3rd 'DOC' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.
  4th 'DOX' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.
  5th 'iNF' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.
  6th 'LST' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.
  7th 'NFO' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.
  8th 'REP' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.
  9th 'SLV' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.
 10th 'SOL' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.
 11th 'DMS' AS A  DMSF-iLE.
 12th 'LHA' AS A  LHA-FiLE.
 13th 'LZH' AS A  LZH-FiLE.
 14th 'EXE' AS AN EXE-FiLE.

TO SEE ALL THE FUNCTiONS OF FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0 YOU SHOULD
BETTER TAKE A LOOK AT @{" HOW TO EDiT THE CONFiG-FiLES " LiNK CONFiGS}.

AND NOW i THiNK i GAVE YOU ENOUGH REASONS TO iNSTALL 
FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0 :)

@ENDNODE

@NODE iNSTALLATiON "iNSTALLATiON OF FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0"

  COPY ALL THE FiLES FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEV TO YOUR BBS.

  NOW EDiT THE @{"TOOLTYPES" LiNK TOOLTYPES} OF 'DiZSTRiP'N'ADD.info'.
  YOU WiLL FiND iT iN 'BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/DiZSTRiP'N'ADD/'.

  AT LAST EDiT THE @{"CONFiG-FiLES" LiNK CONFiGS}. YOU WiLL FiND THEM
  ALL iN 'BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/DiZSTRiP'N'ADD/'.

  NOTE!

  BE SURE YOU HAVE THE FOLLOWiNG FiLES iN YOUR C-DiRECTORY. WiTHOUT
  THESE FiLES FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0 WON'T WORK 100% :

  1. DELETE
  2. COPY
  3. RENAME
  4. TXTEXTRACT
  5. EXEDESCRiPT
  6. DMSDESCRiPT
  7. LHA

  YOU WiLL FiND THESE FiLES ALSO iN THE GiVEN LHA-ARCHiVE.

@ENDNODE

@NODE TOOLTYPES "HOW TO EDiT THE TOOLTYPES?"

THE iCON 'DiZSTRiP'N'ADD.iNFO' HAS ONLY ONE TOOLTYPE:

 STRiP'N'ADDTYPE=<number>


 YOU CAN USE THE FOLLOWiNG NUMBERS (FOLLOWED BY THE DESCRiPTiON WHAT iS
 DOES).

 STRiP'N'ADDTYPE=1

 : ADDS A NORMAL TAG-LiNE TO FiLE_iD.DiZ OF THE UPLOADED FiLE ONLY.


 STRiP'N'ADDTYPE=2

 : STRiPS LiNES OUT OF THE FiLE_iD.DiZ OF THE UPLOADED FiLE ONLY.


 STRiP'N'ADDTYPE=3 (ONLY AVAiLABLE iN A REGiSTERED VERSiON !!!)

 : iNCLUDES THE FEATURES OF STRiP'N'ADDTYPE 1+2.


 STRiP'N'ADDTYPE=4

 : ADDS A TAG-LiNE WiTH UPLOAD-DATE AND UPLOAD-TiME ONLY.


 STRiP'N'ADDTYPE=5 (ONLY AVAiLABLE iN A REGiSTERED VERSiON !!!)

 : iNCLUDES THE FEATURES OF STRiP'N'ADDTYPE 2+4.


 STRiP'N'ADDTYPE=6

 : ADDS A TAG-LiNE WiTH UPLOAD-DATE AND UPLOAD-TiME OR A NORMAL TAG-LiNE
   TO THE FiLE_iD.DiZ OF THE UPLOADED FiLE. THiS iS CHOSEN RANDOMLY WiTH
   A PERCENTAGE CHANCE.


 STRiP'N'ADDTYPE=7 (ONLY AVAiLABLE iN A REGiSTERED VERSiON !!!)

 : iNCLUDES THE FEATURES OF STRiP'N'ADDTYPE 2+6.

 
 TO GET TO KNOW HOW TO GET A REGiSTERED VERSiON WiTH ALL FEATURES AVAiLABLE
 READ @{" HOW TO GET REGiSTERED " LiNK REGiSTER}.

 THAT SHOULD BE ALL FOR NOW...

@ENDNODE       

@NODE CONFiGS "HOW TO EDiT THE CONFiG-FiLES OF 'FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0'."

THERE ARE THREE CONFiG-FiLES WHiCH MUST BE EDiTED. THEY ARE ALL LOCATED iN
'BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/DiZSTRiP'N'ADD/'.

 1st: DiZ.CFG

      1st LiNE: BBSNAME <- MAY BE HAVE A MAXiMUM OF 17 CHARACTERS

      2nd LiNE: PECENT  <- THiS VALUE iS THE PERCENT VALUE FOR THE
                           COMBiNED (DATE-TAG-LiNE & NORMAL-TAG-LiNE)
                           OPTiONS GiVEN iN THE TOOLTYPES.

                           E.G.: YOU HAVE SET THE STRiP'N'ADDTYPE=6
                                 AND THE PERCENT iS SET TO 30 THEN
                                 THERE iS A CHANCE OF 30 PERCENT
                                 THAT A TAG-LiNE WiTH UPLOAD-DATE
                                 AND UPLOAD-TiME WiLL BE ADDED TO
                                 THE FiLE_iD.DiZ OF THE UPLOADED
                                 FiLE.


 2nd: DiZ.ADD

      1st LiNE: NUMBER  <- THiS iS THE NUMBER OF LiNES WHiCH WiLL
                           BE ADDED RANDOMLY THAT FOLLOW. YOU
                           CAN HAVE AS MANY LiNES AS YOU WANT.

      2nd LiNE: LiNE    <- FiRST TAG-LiNE THAT MAYBE WiLL BE ADDED.
      3rd LiNE: LiNE    <- SECOND TAG-LiNE THAT MAYBE WiLL BE ADDED.
      4th LiNE: LiNE    <- BLAH...BLAH...BLAH...


 3rd: DiZ.STRiP

      1st LiNE: LiNE    <- LiNE TO DELETE OUT OF FiLE_iD.DiZ.
      2nd LiNE: LiNE    <- LiNE TO DELETE OUT OF FiLE_iD.DiZ.
      3rd LiNE: LiNE    <- LiNE TO DELETE OUT OF FiLE_iD.DiZ.

 ATTENTiON:

 AS YOU SEE iN THE GiVEN CONFiG-FiLE, THERE ARE NOT ONLY COMPLETE (44
 CHARACTERS LONG) TAG-LiNES. YOU CAN ALSO GiVE A STRiNG, WHiCH iS iN
 THE TAG-LiNE YOU WANT TO STRiP OUT OF THE FiLE_iD.DiZ OF THE UPLOADED
 FiLE. THiS iS VERY USEFUL, SiNCE SYSOPS USiNG THE ADD-FUNCTiON CHANGE
 ONLY A FEW CHARACTERS OF THE TAG-LiNE WHiCH SHOULD BE ADDED.

 !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! 
 !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!!
 !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!!

 DO NOT MAKE A RETURN AFTER THE LAST LiNE iN THE DiZ.STRiP. LEAVE THE
 CURSOR RiGHT BEHiND THE LAST TAG-LiNE. iF YOU DON'T DO THiS, FiLE_iD.DiZ
 STRiP'N'ADD VERSiON 1.0 WiLL STRiP EVERYTHiNG OUT OF THE FiLE_iD.DiZ.

 !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!!
 !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!!
 !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!!

@ENDNODE

@NODE REGiSTER "HOW TO GET REGiSTERED ?"

YOU WANNA GET A REGiSTERED VERSiON OF FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0 ?

THEN DO THE FOLLOWiNG:

 1. CALL KEY WEST - OSiRiS EUROPEAN HEADQUARTER

 2. LEAVE A MESSAGE TO THE SYSOP WiTH THE FOLLOWiNG DATA:

    NAME OF THE BBS WHiCH WANTS TO RUN FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0
    NAME OF THE SYSOP OF THE BBS WHiCH WANTS TO RUN 
    FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0

 3. CALL BACK WiTHiN 24 HOURS AND YOU'LL GET A FULL REGiSTERED VERSiON
    OF FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0

 4. HAVE FUN WiTH FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP'N'ADD V1.0

@ENDNODE

